{"unit_id":"levodoubt__project-node-memory#card-zh","repo":"levodoubt/project-node-memory","commit":"4acbd4d5fd5f188e37ac0b8196b3f79a5174bfed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"project-node-memory 是 DSH Web 插件，把项目中的 Markdown 文件组织成可寻址的长期知识库。它在 DSH 注册知识库工具、系统提示词与按需加载的写作 skill，并提供侧边栏知识节点面板。主要功能包括按 TID 读取节点、中文检索、引用展开、结构诊断、校验后写入和文件重命名。适合希望让 Agent 跨会话沉淀项目决策、事实与待办的开发者；无需 API 密钥，知识以本地 .nodekb Markdown 文件保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-19","lib/host/tools.js:133-142","lib/engine/mdlib.js:67-70"]}
{"unit_id":"levodoubt__project-node-memory#card-en","repo":"levodoubt/project-node-memory","commit":"4acbd4d5fd5f188e37ac0b8196b3f79a5174bfed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"project-node-memory turns project Markdown into a DSH knowledge base. It adds agent tools for reading, searching, validating and updating stable knowledge nodes, plus a Web sidebar panel. Notes stay in local .nodekb/ files; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-19","lib/host/tools.js:133-142","lib/engine/mdlib.js:67-70"]}
